{"parse": {"title": "太阳的背面-07", "pageid": 84873, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%8C%E9%9D%A2-06\" title=\"太阳的背面-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">太阳的背面-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%8C%E9%9D%A2-08\" title=\"太阳的背面-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">太阳的背面</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.A2.86.E5.A5.96.E5.8F.B0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"领奖台\">领奖台</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 领奖台</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Podium</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2350107</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">广播：</div><div>让我们恭喜夏洛特·奥黑根！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奖牌沉甸甸的重量压在了她的脖子上，闪光灯在四处亮起，恍惚间她觉得自己正置身于一个永恒的白昼中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者Ⅰ：</div><div>快——拍下她脚上的伤疤！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者Ⅱ：</div><div>夏洛特选手！恭喜你在乌卢鲁运动会上获得冠军！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者Ⅱ：</div><div>你打破了历史纪录，是“自由祭祀”年龄最小的获奖者——针对这一路上的艰辛付出，你有什么想说的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她低下头，金灿灿的奖牌正悬置于她的胸前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我摘到了太阳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者Ⅱ：</div><div>太阳？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩微笑着举起了那块金牌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>没错，这是我的太阳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者Ⅰ：</div><div>——绝佳的角度，这是一张优秀的版面图。夏洛特，可以把金牌举高一点吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩将金牌举得更高了，无数闪光灯使那块金牌熠熠生辉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者Ⅰ：</div><div>太好了……我们计划在下周进行一个专访……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者Ⅲ：</div><div>菲利普，你占用太多的时间了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个记者挤到了夏洛特的面前，他的西装因为拥挤而显得皱巴巴的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者Ⅲ：</div><div>轮到我了！夏洛特选手，你接下来的目标是什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩被淹没在了话语声和闪光灯中。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喧闹结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……只是如此吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那块沉甸甸的金牌正被摆放在她的手心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-628914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-628914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-628914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……我赢了，但是然后呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-628814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-628814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-628814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你还太小了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵熟悉的脚步声传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>在此之前，你曾听闻的所有故事，都停留在了“获得金牌”的这一刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>没有人告诉你，获得金牌之后又该做什么——故事很轻易地就可以拥有结局，但人生远比故事要漫长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>——可是我拿到了金牌！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她奋力地为自己争辩着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我打败了卡洛琳，刷新了所有人的纪录——我是最年轻的冠军，在之前的历史从来没有过11岁的冠军！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>……所以呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我的名字会被记在报纸上……所有人都会记住我。在下一次乌卢鲁运动会上，他们会叫着我的名字，为我加油……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>然后……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>然后你的名字就会成为一个标志、一个符号——出现在人们即兴的演说和茶余饭后的谈资中。连你自己都只会沉溺于昔日的幻影，成为追逐另一个符号的牺牲者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>直到你忘却自己应该是什么样子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_at_duitan2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_at_duitan2\"><img alt=\"2_3_at_duitan2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-2_3_at_duitan2.png/600px-Cg-2_3_at_duitan2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-2_3_at_duitan2.png/900px-Cg-2_3_at_duitan2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-2_3_at_duitan2.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_at_duitan2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>人总有死亡的一天，但“自由祭祀”永远存在——它就是符号本身。个人意志太过脆弱，又怎么可能战胜一个坚不可摧的符号？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>夏洛特，你的悲剧从今天开始了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女人冷酷地宣告着判决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>当你直视太阳时，别忘了阳光与阴影同出一源。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……我为它付出了那么多的努力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她攥紧了那枚金牌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我战胜了所有人，才拿到了它——它就是金牌……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我要从很早就起床，练习到身心俱疲，才能换来一个拥有它的可能性——但现在，我拿到它了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>你以为我看不出其他人眼里的渴望吗？这是她们想拿又拿不到的东西……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她咬了咬牙，鼓起勇气直视着教练。眼前女人的面孔如同涟漪，正在轻微地颤动着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>——如果它正是悲剧的起源，我们又为什么会渴望它？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-628812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-628812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-628812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>……呵。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随着女人的冷笑声，她的样貌逐渐变得清晰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>它不需要任何理由——因为它是金牌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>正是因为它是金牌，所以你就走了下去。哪怕双脚鲜血淋漓，你也无法摆脱这场有关于自我的祭祀——因为这就是你自找的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>……这不就是你可悲的根源吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "太阳的背面-07"}}